    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**Number formatting shortcuts** change how values look without altering the underlying number. Hold `Ctrl+Shift` and press a key: `Ctrl+Shift+1` number (two decimals), `Ctrl+Shift+4` currency, `Ctrl+Shift+5` percent, `Ctrl+Shift+3` date, and `Ctrl+Shift+~` general (plain). Mac uses the exact same keys with `⌃` (Control)."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "select",
      "prompt": "A coffee roastery prepares an invoice. Click the weight of Arabica in `C2` to select it.",
      "grid": [
        ["Item", "Date", "Weight", "Price", "Discount"],
        ["Arabica", 45672, 1250, 45, 0.15],
        ["Robusta", 45673, 850, 32, 0.1],
        ["Cold brew", 45674, 420, 18, 0.05],
        ["Espresso", 45675, 1600, 54, 0.2],
        ["Total", null, 4120, 149, null]
